er roles to execute the requested GIS workflow end-to-end.\n- **Rationale**: A single concrete subtask reduces dispatch drift when planner LLM is unavailable.\n', 'plan_file_path': 'output\\20260526_20_11_19_bd021d83\\planner\\plan.md', 'allowed_roles': ['Coder', 'Cartographer', 'Reporter']}
